WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.735
- All right, listen up, y'all.

00:00:02.768 --> 00:00:05.471
I'm y'all's substitute teacher,
Mr. Garvey.

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:09.375
I taught school for 20 years
in the inner city,

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:11.544
so don't even think
about messing with me.

00:00:11.577 --> 00:00:13.179
Y'all feel me?

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:14.213
- Mm-hmm.

00:00:14.246 --> 00:00:15.782
- Okay. Let's take roll here.

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:18.618
Jay Quellin.

00:00:21.587 --> 00:00:23.356
Where's Jay Quellin at?

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:24.424
No Jay Quellin here?

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:28.227
Yeah.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.496
- Uh, do you mean "Jacqueline"?

00:00:30.529 --> 00:00:31.764
- Okay.

00:00:31.797 --> 00:00:33.566
So that's how it's gonna be.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:35.268
Y'all wanna play.

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:37.403
Okay, then.

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:38.671
I got my eyes on you,
Jay Quellin.

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:44.210
Balakay.

00:00:45.611 --> 00:00:46.713
Where is Balakay at?

00:00:48.447 --> 00:00:50.083
There's no Balakay here today?

00:00:52.451 --> 00:00:53.519
Yes, sir.

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:54.554
- My name is Blake.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.722
- Bl...

00:00:56.755 --> 00:00:57.824
Are you out of
your goddamn mind?

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.527
"Blake"! What?

00:01:01.560 --> 00:01:02.562
Do you wanna go to war, Balakey?

00:01:02.595 --> 00:01:03.863
- No.

00:01:03.896 --> 00:01:05.465
- 'cause we could go to war.
- No.

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.166
- I'm for real.

00:01:07.199 --> 00:01:09.168
I'm for real.

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:10.470
So you better check yourself.

00:01:13.305 --> 00:01:14.074
Dee-nice.

00:01:15.841 --> 00:01:17.477
Is there a Dee-Nice?

00:01:20.212 --> 00:01:23.450
If one of y'all says
some silly-ass name...

00:01:24.783 --> 00:01:28.454
This whole class
is gonna feel my wrath.

00:01:28.487 --> 00:01:29.856
Now, Dee-Nice.

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:31.257
- Do you mean "Denise"?

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.529
- You say your name right,
right now.

00:01:36.562 --> 00:01:37.630
- Denise?
- You say it right.

00:01:37.663 --> 00:01:38.664
- Denise.
- Correctly.

00:01:38.697 --> 00:01:39.699
- Denise.
- Right.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.300
- Denise.
- Right.

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:43.302
- Dee-Nice?
- That's better. Thank you.

00:01:43.335 --> 00:01:45.705
Now, A.A. Ron.

00:01:46.672 --> 00:01:48.608
Where are you?

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:50.176
Where is A.A. Ron right now?

00:01:51.844 --> 00:01:54.180
No A. A. Ron, huh?

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:58.618
Well, you better be sick,
dead or mute, A.A. Ron.

00:01:58.651 --> 00:02:00.253
- Here! Oh, man.

00:02:02.454 --> 00:02:03.656
- Why didn't you answer me
the first time I said it, huh?

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.525
- Huh?

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:06.926
- You know, I'm just asking you.
I said it, like, four times.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:08.494
So, why didn't you say it

00:02:08.527 --> 00:02:10.730
the first time
I said, "A.A. Ron"?

00:02:13.699 --> 00:02:15.268
- Because it's pronounced
"Aaron".

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:16.703
- Son of a bitch!

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:20.740
You done messed up, A.A. Ron!

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:23.609
Now take your ass on down
to Oh-Shag-Henessy's office,

00:02:23.642 --> 00:02:25.578
right now, and tell him exactly
what you did!

00:02:26.912 --> 00:02:29.149
- Who?
- Oh-Shag-Henessy!

00:02:30.849 --> 00:02:31.951
- Principal O'Shaughnessy?

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:33.886
Get out of my goddamn classroom

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:36.222
before I break
my foot off in your ass!

00:02:36.255 --> 00:02:37.190
Insubordinate...

00:02:38.557 --> 00:02:39.526
and churlish.

00:02:44.663 --> 00:02:46.766
Tym-Oh-Thee.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:48.234
- Present.

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:49.269
- Thank you.

00:02:50.636 --> 00:02:52.538
- All right, we're gonna
take a little roll here.

00:02:52.571 --> 00:02:54.407
Jay-Kwelin.
- Here.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.644
- You are present?
Ba-Lakay.

00:02:59.245 --> 00:03:00.546
- Uh, here.
- Uh-huh.

00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:02.749
- De-Nice, Good.
- Here.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:06.486
- Je-Seeka. Thank you.

00:03:08.887 --> 00:03:09.622
- Mr. Garvey?

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:12.892
- What is it, A-Aron?

00:03:12.925 --> 00:03:15.295
- Some of us need to leave
a few minutes early today.

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.363
- Oh.

00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:21.267
- Oh, is that so?
- Mm-hmm.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.804
- And what, pray tell...

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:28.441
is the reason
for this premature exodus?

00:03:29.608 --> 00:03:31.611
- Yearbook photos.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:34.347
Um, we have to leave
15 minutes early

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.915
to meet up with our clubs.

00:03:35.948 --> 00:03:38.351
- [chuckles]

00:03:38.384 --> 00:03:39.885
All right, you know what?

00:03:39.918 --> 00:03:42.288
That might work
with other substitute teachers,

00:03:42.321 --> 00:03:45.925
but I taught in the inner city
for over 20 years.

00:03:45.958 --> 00:03:49.495
Now, y'all wanna leave
my class early,

00:03:49.528 --> 00:03:51.664
so y'all can go meet up
at the club.

00:03:53.499 --> 00:03:57.403
Ain't none of y'all old enough
to go to the damn club!

00:03:58.337 --> 00:03:59.539
Ridiculous.

00:04:00.839 --> 00:04:03.376
- Mr. Garvey?
- Dumb son of a bitch!

00:04:04.476 --> 00:04:06.946
Did I st-st-st-st-st-stutter?

00:04:06.979 --> 00:04:08.881
- Just then, yes.

00:04:08.914 --> 00:04:11.851
- I'm gonna throw you
out the goddamn window!

00:04:13.485 --> 00:04:14.887
What, Jay-Kwelin?

00:04:14.920 --> 00:04:16.722
- Mr. Garvey, we're...
we're telling the truth.

00:04:16.755 --> 00:04:18.024
We... We have clubs
at the school.

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:19.959
We have clubs
for special interests.

00:04:19.992 --> 00:04:23.062
- Okay, I see.
So y'all wanna play.

00:04:23.095 --> 00:04:24.664
Y'all wanna play.

00:04:24.697 --> 00:04:26.399
Yeah, okay,
we gonna play little games.

00:04:26.432 --> 00:04:28.301
Fine. I'll play.

00:04:28.334 --> 00:04:30.770
I'm more than happy to play
some games with y'all.

00:04:30.803 --> 00:04:34.374
Anyone who's in a club,
stand your ass up.

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:39.045
Uh-huh. Oh, yeah,
there it is, there it is.

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:40.980
The usual suspects.

00:04:41.013 --> 00:04:44.417
What the hell club
are you in, Jay-Kwelin?

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:46.018
- Future leaders of America.

00:04:46.051 --> 00:04:47.820
- Okay, okay.

00:04:49.521 --> 00:04:52.558
How would you know
if you're gonna be a leader

00:04:52.591 --> 00:04:53.859
in the future?

00:04:53.892 --> 00:04:56.896
Is there a stargate
in your bedroom?

00:04:56.929 --> 00:04:59.332
Can you travel through time,
Jay-Kwelin?

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:01.600
- No.
- Then sit the flip down!

00:05:01.633 --> 00:05:03.102
Ba-Lakay,
l... Here's the thing.

00:05:03.135 --> 00:05:05.738
I don't even know
why I'm about to ask you this.

00:05:05.771 --> 00:05:08.708
Ba-Lakay, what club are you in?

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:10.643
- I'm part of the Spanish club.

00:05:10.676 --> 00:05:14.413
- Span... The Sp... You about
as Spanish as Ree-On Seacrest,

00:05:14.446 --> 00:05:16.549
with your big-ass
Fraggle Rock hair!

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:19.618
How about you, De-Nice?

00:05:19.651 --> 00:05:20.620
- I'm in the chess club.

00:05:22.855 --> 00:05:24.557
- Uh, I'm sorry, sweetheart,

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:27.560
you are not in the chest club.

00:05:27.593 --> 00:05:29.829
The mosquito bite club, maybe.

00:05:29.862 --> 00:05:31.731
- Ah, that's hurtful.
- Truthful.

00:05:33.732 --> 00:05:35.468
There he is.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.770
- A-Aron...
- Hey.

00:05:37.803 --> 00:05:41.006
- What club are you in?

00:05:41.039 --> 00:05:42.541
- I'm the president
of the glee club.

00:05:42.574 --> 00:05:43.642
Why did I talk?

00:05:43.675 --> 00:05:46.545
- The glee club? Aah!

00:05:46.578 --> 00:05:48.614
Like they gonna have a club

00:05:48.647 --> 00:05:51.517
dedicated to a TV show!

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:52.852
Take your ass,

00:05:52.885 --> 00:05:54.854
to O-Shag-Hennessey's
office right now,

00:05:54.887 --> 00:05:57.923
before I bust a club
up in your butt!

00:05:57.956 --> 00:05:59.792
- Okay.
- Go!

00:05:59.825 --> 00:06:01.594
- [crying]
Okay, I'm gonna go.

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:03.028
- Mischievous and deceitful!

00:06:03.061 --> 00:06:05.564
Chicanerous and deplorable.

00:06:05.597 --> 00:06:07.600
- This is Principal
O'Shaughnessy.

00:06:07.633 --> 00:06:09.468
Students, please report
to the gymnasium

00:06:09.501 --> 00:06:10.603
for your club photos.

00:06:10.636 --> 00:06:12.037
- Fake announcement.

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:15.574
Now, does anybody in here
have a valid reason

00:06:15.607 --> 00:06:16.976
for leaving this classroom?

00:06:17.009 --> 00:06:18.444
T-Mothy.

00:06:18.477 --> 00:06:19.111
- I gotta go pick up
my daughter.

00:06:19.144 --> 00:06:20.277
- You're excused.

